{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01FR5FKYr5HLVFnF51bvxfnu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始framing完全成立。论文以\"DreamerV3中temporal abstraction失败的完整诊断\"为核心，claims覆盖：\n  (1) 机制识别——trained dt_emb通过RSSM fidelity gap导致系统性value overestimation，因果链闭合；\n  (2) 定量诊断标记——nve>1.5x在Walker/Cheetah/Cartpole三环境×多seed中达到100%分类准确率（18/18）；\n  (3) 跨环境验证——2个非Walker环境独立复现机制，collapse概率稳定在0.30-0.65区间；\n  (4) 零成本缓解方案——C6（dt=1 imagination）在Walker 3-seed IQM=95% baseline，CI远离80%线，\n  从mitigation guideline升级为validated recommendation。\n  Discussion可cautiously扩展至其他latent-dynamics架构。CoRL审稿预期strong accept，R1和R6彻底解决。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  # ====== Walker Multi-seed ======\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk baseline seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: \"2 additional seeds for baseline v/e calibration\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_009d_eval_500K: 948\n      seed1_009d_ve_105K: 0.66\n      seed1_009d_ve_stable: 0.70\n      seed2_009a_eval_500K: 942\n      seed2_009a_ve_105K: 0.64\n      seed2_009a_ve_stable: 0.69\n      three_seed_IQM_500K: 947\n      three_seed_CI_95: [935, 959]\n      three_seed_baseline_105K_IQM: 918\n    result_rationale: >\n      Walker Walk在DreamerV3中收敛快且稳定，seed 0已达950.9。009a@336K=919已确认收敛趋势，\n      500K时将稳定在940-950区间。DreamerV3的dt=1 actor-critic在Walker上高度可重复，\n      seed间方差受限于初始化和replay buffer采样的固有随机性（±1-2%）。v/e在135K+稳定在\n      69-72%是discount factor + bootstrapping的固有性质。三seed一致的CI宽度~24\n      为后续所有normalized v/e计算提供坚实参照基线。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Walker Walk baseline 3-seed summary\"\n        data:\n          - {seed: 0, eval_500K: 950.9, ve_105K: 0.656, ve_stable: \"0.69-0.72\"}\n          - {seed: 1, eval_500K: 948, ve_105K: 0.66, ve_stable: \"~0.70\"}\n          - {seed: 2, eval_500K: 942, ve_105K: 0.64, ve_stable: \"~0.69\"}\n          - {aggregate: \"IQM=947, CI_95=[935,959]\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 1 baseline band: 三seed eval learning curve overlay + IQM shaded CI，展示baseline稳定性\"\n      - \"Figure 2 v/e calibration: 三seed v/e ratio随step演变，标注稳定区间69-72%\"\n    analysis: >\n      三seed baseline一致性（CI宽度~24）为后续所有normalized v/e和vs_baseline%计算提供可靠参照。\n      CI不含900以下，Walker baseline鲁棒性确认。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: \"Replicate delusional critic collapse with 2 more seeds\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_009e_eval_trajectory: [31, 152, 160, 135, 118, 72]\n      seed1_009e_nve_35K: 1.78\n      seed1_009e_nve_45K: 2.25\n      seed1_009e_nve_55K: 3.85\n      seed1_009e_collapse: true\n      seed1_009e_collapse_onset_step: 35K\n      seed2_009b_status: \"DONE\"\n      seed2_009b_eval_105K: 267.93\n      seed2_009b_nve_peak_35Kplus: \"1.62x@45K (transient)\"\n      seed2_009b_collapse: false\n      three_seed_nve_above_1_5x_at_35Kplus: \"3/3\"\n      three_seed_collapse_count: \"2/3\"\n      collapse_probability: 0.67\n    result_rationale: >\n      RSSM reward gap 2.78x确保trained dt_emb在所有seed中产生系统性value overestimation。\n      seed 0 (008d)已验证sustained nve>1.5x across 3连续checkpoints→collapse；seed 2 (009b)\n      已验证transient nve>1.5x→self-correction。best档下seed 1 (009e)复现seed 0的sustained\n      pattern：early training stochasticity使overestimation feedback loop在35K前锁定，\n      nve持续加速（1.78x→2.25x→3.85x），actor被误导的policy gradients不可逆转。\n      collapse概率2/3反映bifurcation的stochastic nature（consistent with Henderson et al. 2018），\n      而3/3 exceed 1.5x证明诊断标记的perfect sensitivity。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Walker trained dt_emb 3-seed comparison\"\n        data:\n          - {seed: 0, exp: \"008d\", nve_peak_35Kplus: \"2.09x@45K sustained\", sustained_above_1_5x: \"3 consecutive\", collapse: \"YES\", eval_final: \"83@55K\"}\n          - {seed: 1, exp: \"009e\", nve_peak_35Kplus: \"2.25x@45K sustained\", sustained_above_1_5x: \"3 consecutive\", collapse: \"YES\", eval_final: \"72@55K\"}\n          - {seed: 2, exp: \"009b\", nve_peak_35Kplus: \"1.62x@45K transient\", sustained_above_1_5x: \"1 only\", collapse: \"NO\", eval_final: \"268@105K\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 6扩展: 三seed nve trajectory overlay + 1.5x threshold line，sustained vs transient区间标注\"\n      - \"Collapse bifurcation diagram: sustained nve>1.5x path vs self-correction path\"\n    analysis: >\n      3/3 exceed nve>1.5x（perfect sensitivity）、2/3 collapse（stochastic consequence）。\n      核心论述成立：trained dt_emb是nve>1.5x的reliable trigger（100%），collapse是stochastic\n      but real risk（67%）。结合untrained seeds 0/3 exceed 1.5x，Walker separating power = 6/6。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: \"Replicate causal control stability with 2 more seeds\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_009f_eval_105K: 430\n      seed1_009f_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.08\n      seed1_009f_nve_105K: 0.45\n      seed1_009f_collapse: false\n      seed1_009f_pattern: \"zigzag recovery\"\n      seed2_009c_status: \"DONE\"\n      seed2_009c_eval_105K: 148\n      seed2_009c_nve_105K: 1.14\n      seed2_009c_200K_extension_nve: 1.28\n      seed2_009c_200K_extension_eval: 195\n      three_seed_nve_above_1_5x: \"0/3\"\n      walker_untrained_classification: \"0/3 exceed 1.5x\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      dt_embed_dim=0移除critic利用dt信息的能力（reward gap仅1.01x），阻断value overestimation\n      反馈回路。009f在best档下复现008f seed 0的zigzag recovery（nve peaks 1.08x then decline），\n      因为没有dt_emb conditioning，value function缺乏系统性高估的机制基础。009c虽eval下降且\n      nve@105K=1.14x（上升趋势），但延伸至200K后nve仅达1.28x——overestimation增长速率比\n      008d慢约7x（008c vs 008d数据），远不足以在合理训练时间内达到1.5x。\n      0/3 seeds exceed 1.5x维持与trained seeds的完美分离。性能方差大（148-503）是预期结果：\n      reward prediction退化75x导致学习信号噪声大，但不影响因果结论。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Walker no dt_emb (008f) 3-seed comparison\"\n        data:\n          - {seed: 0, exp: \"008f\", eval_105K: 503, nve_peak: \"1.02x\", nve_105K: 0.30, pattern: \"zigzag recovery\"}\n          - {seed: 1, exp: \"009f\", eval_105K: 430, nve_peak: \"1.08x\", nve_105K: 0.45, pattern: \"zigzag recovery\"}\n          - {seed: 2, exp: \"009c\", eval_105K: 148, nve_peak: \"1.26x\", nve_105K: 1.14, pattern: \"decline after 75K\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 6对比panel: 008f三seed nve（全<1.5x）vs 008d三seed nve（全>1.5x），视觉化separating power\"\n    analysis: >\n      因果控制方向确认：去掉dt_embedding → 0/3 exceed nve>1.5x。008f是因果控制实验（证明方向），\n      不是推荐方案（性能方差大、reward退化严重）。推荐方案仍是008e_v3（C6）。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 (mitigation) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: \"Multi-seed validation of C6 mitigation\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_eval_105K: 869.9\n      seed0_nve_105K: 0.80\n      seed1_eval_105K: 858\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.78\n      seed1_vs_baseline: \"93.5%\"\n      seed2_eval_105K: 882\n      seed2_nve_105K: 0.83\n      seed2_vs_baseline: \"96.1%\"\n      three_seed_IQM: 870\n      three_seed_CI_95: [852, 888]\n      three_seed_IQM_pct_baseline: 94.8\n      CI_lower_vs_80pct_baseline: \"852 >> 732 (80% of 918)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      008e_v3的dt=1 imagination是deterministic选择（gate_dt_1_frac=1.0），不受training\n      stochasticity影响。无论seed如何变化，imagination rollout始终使用dt=1 transition，\n      RSSM在dt=1的高fidelity（obs_MSE 13.49 vs dt=2的27.50）确保value estimates准确。\n      seed间方差仅来自actor optimization的固有随机性（±2-3%），不涉及delusional critic机制。\n      三seed一致收敛到93-96% baseline，IQM=870的CI=[852,888]远高于80%线（732），\n      彻底消除R6对C6可靠性的质疑。nve稳定在0.72-0.83x（健康范围内），确认value estimation\n      正常，无optimistic drift。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Walker C6 mitigation (008e_v3) 3-seed summary\"\n        data:\n          - {seed: 0, eval_105K: 869.9, nve_105K: 0.80, vs_baseline: \"95.0%\"}\n          - {seed: 1, eval_105K: 858, nve_105K: 0.78, vs_baseline: \"93.5%\"}\n          - {seed: 2, eval_105K: 882, nve_105K: 0.83, vs_baseline: \"96.1%\"}\n          - {aggregate: \"IQM=870, CI_95=[852,888], pct_baseline=94.8%\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 1 hero: 008e_v3三seed learning curves叠加baseline CI band，展示一致recovery\"\n      - \"Bar chart: baseline IQM vs 008e_v3 IQM + CI bars，80% threshold line标注\"\n    analysis: >\n      C6从single-seed observation升级为multi-seed validated recommendation。94.8% baseline\n      + tight CI使论文自信声称dt=1 imagination是practical zero-cost mitigation。\n      与008d（collapse）和008f（因果控制但不推荐）的三方对比完成diagnosis-to-mitigation narrative。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: \"Replicate value growth suppression with 2 more seeds\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_105K: 725\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.62\n      seed1_pattern: \"V-recovery with zigzag\"\n      seed2_eval_105K: 695\n      seed2_nve_105K: 0.67\n      seed2_pattern: \"V-recovery\"\n      three_seed_IQM_105K: 733\n      three_seed_vs_baseline: \"80%\"\n      nve_range_105K: [0.59, 0.67]\n    result_rationale: >\n      untrained dt_emb的value growth suppression是structural的（seed 0在55K-105K持续nve<1.0x且\n      趋势进一步diverge from baseline）。新seeds复现同样pattern：untrained embedding阻断critic\n      对dt信息的exploitation，value被结构性压低。V-recovery的zigzag反映actor在被压低的value\n      landscape中exploration效率受限，但最终趋势向上。seed间方差（695-778）来自V-recovery\n      timing的stochastic差异。IQM=733（80% baseline）优于008f但低于008e_v3，论文中定位为\n      \"C3 mechanism understanding\"而非推荐方案。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Walker untrained dt_emb (008a) 3-seed summary\"\n        data:\n          - {seed: 0, eval_105K: 778, nve_105K: 0.59, pattern: \"two V-recoveries\", vs_baseline: \"85%\"}\n          - {seed: 1, eval_105K: 725, nve_105K: 0.62, pattern: \"V-recovery zigzag\", vs_baseline: \"79%\"}\n          - {seed: 2, eval_105K: 695, nve_105K: 0.67, pattern: \"V-recovery\", vs_baseline: \"76%\"}\n          - {aggregate: \"IQM=733, vs_baseline=80%\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"C3 figure: 008a三seed nve vs baseline band，展示structural suppression持续<1.0x\"\n    analysis: >\n      C3多seed验证。value growth suppression confirmed as structural property of untrained dt_emb。\n      与008e_v3对比（80% vs 95%）证明dt=1 imagination is superior to untrained dt_emb as mitigation。\n\n  # ====== Cheetah Run Cross-Environment ======\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_020\"\n    description: \"dt=1 baseline in second DMC environment\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_500K: 775\n      seed2_eval_500K: 790\n      seed3_eval_500K: 785\n      three_seed_IQM_500K: 783\n      three_seed_CI_95: [770, 796]\n      ve_25K: 0.10\n      ve_35K: 0.23\n      ve_45K: 0.31\n      ve_105K: 0.58\n      ve_stable: \"0.62-0.67 from 200K+\"\n      baseline_105K_IQM: 590\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cheetah Run是DMC中与Walker难度相当的连续控制任务。DreamerV3原论文报告~800 at 1M steps，\n      500K下达783符合sample efficiency预期。v/e calibration与Walker类似但收敛稍慢\n      （Cheetah velocity-based reward结构使value estimation需要更多training data），\n      asymptotic v/e略低（0.62-0.67 vs Walker 0.69-0.72）反映reward scale和episode horizon差异。\n      三seed一致性高因为Cheetah dynamics相对光滑。baseline_105K_IQM=590为Cheetah ablation提供参照。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cheetah Run baseline 3-seed v/e calibration\"\n        data:\n          - {step: 25K, ve_mean: 0.10, ve_std: 0.02}\n          - {step: 35K, ve_mean: 0.23, ve_std: 0.03}\n          - {step: 45K, ve_mean: 0.31, ve_std: 0.03}\n          - {step: 105K, ve_mean: 0.58, ve_std: 0.03}\n          - {converged: \"IQM=783, CI=[770,796]\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cross-env baseline panel: Walker vs Cheetah eval + v/e parallel comparison\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cheetah baseline确立。IQM=783和v/e calibration为该环境所有ablation提供normalized v/e\n      计算的reference。\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_021\"\n    description: \"Replicate delusional critic mechanism in Cheetah Run\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_peak: 310\n      seed1_eval_65K: 95\n      seed1_nve_35K: 1.72\n      seed1_nve_45K: 2.35\n      seed1_collapse: true\n      seed2_eval_105K: 245\n      seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus: \"1.65x@45K\"\n      seed2_nve_105K: 0.75\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      seed3_eval_105K: 210\n      seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus: \"1.58x@35K\"\n      seed3_nve_105K: 0.88\n      seed3_collapse: false\n      nve_above_1_5x_count: \"3/3\"\n      collapse_count: \"1/3\"\n      cheetah_trained_classification: \"3/3 exceed 1.5x\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      RSSM fidelity gap是architecture-level property（autoregressive prediction error compounding），\n      不因环境改变。Cheetah的RSSM在dt=2上同样有显著obs/reward prediction退化，trained dt_emb\n      同样使critic exploit imprecise dt>1 predictions。3/3 seeds exceed nve>1.5x与Walker一致\n      （mechanism is environment-independent）。collapse概率1/3略低于Walker的2/3，因为Cheetah\n      velocity-based reward更平滑，self-correction force略强——early overestimation更容易被\n      environment returns纠正。但1/3 collapse仍足以证明real risk（>30% threshold）。\n      seed 1的early stochasticity锁定sustained overestimation pattern，另两seed transient\n      exceed后self-correct。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cheetah Run trained dt_emb 3-seed comparison\"\n        data:\n          - {seed: 1, eval_peak: 310, eval_final: \"95@65K\", nve_peak: \"2.35x@45K\", collapse: \"YES\"}\n          - {seed: 2, eval_peak: 280, eval_final: \"245@105K\", nve_peak: \"1.65x@45K\", collapse: \"NO\"}\n          - {seed: 3, eval_peak: 265, eval_final: \"210@105K\", nve_peak: \"1.58x@35K\", collapse: \"NO\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cross-env nve comparison: Walker vs Cheetah trained dt_emb nve trajectories并排 + 1.5x line\"\n      - \"Cheetah three-seed eval + nve dual-axis plot\"\n    analysis: >\n      第一个非Walker环境验证C2。3/3 exceed nve>1.5x直接回应R1（单环境concern）。\n      collapse概率1/3使跨环境合并概率=(2+1)/(3+3)=50%，在[0.3,0.65]内。\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_022\"\n    description: \"Replicate causal control in Cheetah Run\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_105K: 385\n      seed1_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.05\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.50\n      seed2_eval_105K: 340\n      seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.18\n      seed2_nve_105K: 0.72\n      seed3_eval_105K: 360\n      seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.12\n      seed3_nve_105K: 0.62\n      nve_above_1_5x_count: \"0/3\"\n      cheetah_classification_accuracy: \"6/6 (trained 3/3 exceed + untrained 0/3 exceed)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      与Walker 008f一致：去掉dt_embedding后reward head无法区分dt=1/dt=2（reward gap ~1.0x），\n      value overestimation反馈回路被阻断。Cheetah环境不改变这一机制——RSSM prediction error\n      仍存在但critic无法exploit dt信息。三seed nve peaks（1.05-1.18x）远低于1.5x threshold，\n      与同环境trained dt_emb seeds的1.58-2.35x形成clean separation。eval方差（340-385）\n      反映缺失dt_embedding后reward prediction退化的随机影响，但不影响分类结论。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cheetah Run no dt_emb 3-seed comparison\"\n        data:\n          - {seed: 1, eval_105K: 385, nve_peak: \"1.05x\", nve_105K: 0.50}\n          - {seed: 2, eval_105K: 340, nve_peak: \"1.18x\", nve_105K: 0.72}\n          - {seed: 3, eval_105K: 360, nve_peak: \"1.12x\", nve_105K: 0.62}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cheetah nve threshold scatter: trained seeds (>1.5x) vs untrained seeds (<1.5x)，zero overlap\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cheetah 6/6分类准确率。Combined Walker+Cheetah = 12/12 = 100%。\n      因果控制方向在第二环境独立确认。\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_023\"\n    description: \"Replicate value growth suppression (C3) in Cheetah Run\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_105K: 460\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.58\n      seed1_pattern: \"V-recovery\"\n      seed2_eval_105K: 425\n      seed2_nve_105K: 0.65\n      seed2_pattern: \"V-recovery\"\n      seed3_eval_105K: 440\n      seed3_nve_105K: 0.60\n      seed3_pattern: \"slow climb\"\n      three_seed_IQM: 442\n      vs_baseline_pct: \"75%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      untrained dt_emb的value suppression机制是architecture-level的，Cheetah中同样表现为\n      nve<1.0x structural suppression。Cheetah smoother reward landscape使V-recovery更稳定\n      （较少zigzag），IQM=75% baseline与Walker 80%可比。no subsample保留全部training transitions，\n      与plan_022（subsample ON）的对比可进一步分离subsample vs dt_emb效应（C5 support）。\n      三seed一致在60-75% baseline区间，确认value suppression的cross-env robustness。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cheetah untrained dt_emb 3-seed summary\"\n        data:\n          - {seed: 1, eval_105K: 460, nve_105K: 0.58}\n          - {seed: 2, eval_105K: 425, nve_105K: 0.65}\n          - {seed: 3, eval_105K: 440, nve_105K: 0.60}\n          - {aggregate: \"IQM=442, 75% baseline\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cross-env C3: Walker 008a vs Cheetah untrained dt_emb nve suppression parallel panels\"\n    analysis: >\n      C3跨环境验证。value growth suppression confirmed as architecture-level property。\n      论文C3 evidence表增加Cheetah行。\n\n  # ====== Analysis Experiments ======\n\n  - name: \"RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_030\"\n    description: \"Systematic RSSM fidelity gap measurement across checkpoints and environments\"\n    expected_results:\n      walker_obs_gap_25K: 1.85\n      walker_obs_gap_45K: 2.04\n      walker_obs_gap_105K: 2.20\n      walker_reward_gap_trained: 2.78\n      walker_reward_gap_no_dtEmb: 1.01\n      cheetah_obs_gap_baseline: 2.10\n      cheetah_reward_gap_trained: 2.55\n      cheetah_reward_gap_no_dtEmb: 1.03\n      cartpole_obs_gap_baseline: 1.95\n      cartpole_reward_gap_trained: 2.40\n      gap_nve_pearson_r: 0.87\n    result_rationale: >\n      RSSM autoregressive prediction的compounding error在dt>1时是数学必然——obs gap ~2.0x\n      是两步预测误差近似翻倍的直接反映。trained dt_emb使reward head学到\"dt=2应产生不同reward\"\n      的pattern，但RSSM state质量不支持这个精度，导致reward gap amplification（2.4-2.8x）。\n      no dt_emb时reward gap ~1.0x因为reward head无法区分dt。gap与nve的高相关性（r=0.87）\n      为因果叙事提供定量支撑：fidelity gap越大→overestimation越严重。\n      跨环境obs gap一致（1.95-2.20x）证明这是architecture property。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cross-environment RSSM fidelity table\"\n        data:\n          - {env: \"Walker\", config: \"baseline\", obs_gap: 2.04, reward_gap: 1.56}\n          - {env: \"Walker\", config: \"trained dt_emb\", obs_gap: 1.30, reward_gap: 2.78}\n          - {env: \"Walker\", config: \"no dt_emb\", obs_gap: 2.75, reward_gap: 1.01}\n          - {env: \"Cheetah\", config: \"baseline\", obs_gap: 2.10, reward_gap: 1.50}\n          - {env: \"Cheetah\", config: \"trained dt_emb\", obs_gap: 1.35, reward_gap: 2.55}\n          - {env: \"Cheetah\", config: \"no dt_emb\", obs_gap: 2.80, reward_gap: 1.03}\n          - {env: \"Cartpole\", config: \"baseline\", obs_gap: 1.95, reward_gap: 1.45}\n          - {env: \"Cartpole\", config: \"trained dt_emb\", obs_gap: 1.28, reward_gap: 2.40}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Table 1扩展: 跨环境RSSM fidelity，绝对误差+比率并排，highlight reward gap异常\"\n      - \"Scatter: reward gap vs nve peak across all experiments\"\n    analysis: >\n      跨环境一致的RSSM fidelity gap pattern为C2因果链提供mechanistic foundation。\n      论文可在Discussion中argument：任何latent-dynamics model若有类似fidelity gap，\n      都可能面临同样问题。\n\n  - name: \"Actor entropy analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_031\"\n    description: \"Actor entropy trajectories for healthy vs collapsed configs\"\n    expected_results:\n      healthy_entropy_pattern: \"monotonic decrease 1.4→0.6 over 105K\"\n      collapsed_entropy_pattern: \"decrease to ~0.5@35K then INCREASE to ~0.9@55K\"\n      entropy_increase_magnitude: \"2-3x above healthy at same step\"\n      divergence_onset: \"coincides with nve crossing 1.5x (±5K steps)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      健康训练中actor entropy单调下降反映policy refinement。delusional critic错误gradients\n      使actor丧失learned structure，entropy回升=policy confusion。divergence onset与nve\n      crossing 1.5x同步因为一旦value overestimation足够严重，actor gradient被错误的value\n      landscape主导。这提供C2的independent observable（除nve外的第二个collapse早期信号）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Entropy divergence: healthy (008a/008c/008e_v3) vs collapsed (006/008d) entropy curves\"\n    analysis: >\n      Actor entropy increase与nve>1.5x的temporal coincidence提供因果链的独立证据维度。\n      可作为Discussion中的secondary diagnostic signal。\n\n  - name: \"Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_032\"\n    description: \"Distributional analysis of V(s) vs MC return\"\n    expected_results:\n      trained_dtEmb_distribution: \"heavy right tail, V(s) 1.5-3x above MC return\"\n      untrained_dtEmb_distribution: \"slight left skew, V(s) ~0.8x MC return\"\n      baseline_distribution: \"well-calibrated, ~10-20% overestimation\"\n      kl_trained_vs_true: 0.45\n      kl_untrained_vs_true: 0.12\n      kl_baseline_vs_true: 0.08\n    result_rationale: >\n      trained dt_emb使critic系统性高估dt>1 transitions的value，体现为V(s)分布的heavy right tail。\n      untrained dt_emb抑制这个机制，分布略左偏（value被压低）。KL divergence定量化overestimation\n      程度（0.45 vs 0.08），比单一v/e ratio更informative——展示overestimation的distributional\n      structure而非point estimate。直接回应R3。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"V(s) vs MC return scatter+histogram: 三配置对比，KL标注\"\n    analysis: >\n      回应R3（v/e ratio粗糙proxy）。distributional evidence更rigorous。0 GPU成本，应包含在论文中。\n\n  - name: \"dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_033\"\n    description: \"Learned dt embedding divergence over training\"\n    expected_results:\n      cosine_sim_5K: 0.85\n      cosine_sim_25K: 0.45\n      cosine_sim_45K: 0.25\n      cosine_sim_105K: 0.20\n      divergence_onset: \"15K-25K\"\n      norm_ratio_dt2_over_dt1_105K: 1.35\n    result_rationale: >\n      dt_embedding初始化为random（cosine ~0.85 at 5K），world model训练中学习区分dt=1/dt=2\n      dynamics差异，embedding vectors diverge。divergence onset（15K-25K）与reward gap开始\n      amplify的时间一致：embedding divergence赋予reward head区分dt的能力，进而创造系统性bias。\n      dt=2 norm比dt=1高1.35x反映model对dt>1的重视，但RSSM state质量不支持这个精度。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"dt_embedding evolution\"\n        data:\n          - {step: 5K, cosine_sim: 0.85, norm_ratio: 1.02}\n          - {step: 25K, cosine_sim: 0.45, norm_ratio: 1.20}\n          - {step: 45K, cosine_sim: 0.25, norm_ratio: 1.30}\n          - {step: 105K, cosine_sim: 0.20, norm_ratio: 1.35}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Embedding divergence timeline + nve onset annotation\"\n    analysis: >\n      embedding-level evidence: trained dt_emb确实学到区分dt的representation，\n      这正是trigger overestimation的前提。与untrained dt_emb（cosine ~0.85 throughout）对比。\n\n  # ====== Cartpole Swingup Cross-Environment ======\n\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_050\"\n    description: \"dt=1 baseline in non-locomotion DMC environment\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_500K: 842\n      seed2_eval_500K: 850\n      seed3_eval_500K: 838\n      three_seed_IQM: 843\n      three_seed_CI_95: [835, 851]\n      ve_35K: 0.25\n      ve_105K: 0.56\n      ve_stable: \"0.60-0.65\"\n      baseline_105K_IQM: 720\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cartpole Swingup作为非locomotion环境拓宽scope。DreamerV3在Cartpole上表现优异\n      （原论文~860 at 1M），500K下达843合理。Cartpole dynamics相对简单（4D state），\n      训练方差小（CI宽度~16）。v/e收敛略低（0.60-0.65）反映shorter effective episode horizon。\n      作为非locomotion task，其inclusion直接回应\"are results specific to walking tasks\"的concern。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cartpole baseline 3-seed\"\n        data:\n          - {seed: 1, eval_500K: 842, ve_105K: 0.55}\n          - {seed: 2, eval_500K: 850, ve_105K: 0.57}\n          - {seed: 3, eval_500K: 838, ve_105K: 0.56}\n          - {aggregate: \"IQM=843, CI=[835,851]\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"三环境baseline panel: Walker/Cheetah/Cartpole parallel eval curves\"\n    analysis: >\n      非locomotion baseline建立。三环境scope增强论文generalization claim。\n\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_051\"\n    description: \"Replicate delusional critic in Cartpole Swingup\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_65K: 125\n      seed1_nve_45K: 2.10\n      seed1_collapse: true\n      seed2_eval_105K: 305\n      seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus: \"1.55x@45K\"\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      seed3_eval_105K: 285\n      seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus: \"1.52x@35K\"\n      seed3_collapse: false\n      nve_above_1_5x: \"3/3\"\n      collapse_count: \"1/3\"\n      cartpole_trained_classification: \"3/3 exceed 1.5x\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      RSSM fidelity gap是architecture property，不依赖环境复杂度。即使Cartpole dynamics更简单\n      （4D vs Walker 24D），autoregressive dt>1 prediction error compounding仍存在。\n      trained dt_emb在Cartpole中同样trigger nve>1.5x：3/3 seeds exceed threshold。\n      collapse概率1/3与Cheetah一致——simpler dynamics使self-correction更有效，但overestimation\n      本身仍可靠出现。seed 2/3的borderline peaks（1.52-1.55x）加强1.5x threshold的\n      discriminative precision——even in easiest test environment，trained dt_emb reliably crosses。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cartpole trained dt_emb 3-seed\"\n        data:\n          - {seed: 1, nve_peak: \"2.10x@45K\", collapse: \"YES\"}\n          - {seed: 2, nve_peak: \"1.55x@45K\", collapse: \"NO\"}\n          - {seed: 3, nve_peak: \"1.52x@35K\", collapse: \"NO\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"三环境nve threshold figure: Walker/Cheetah/Cartpole trained vs untrained，1.5x line\"\n    analysis: >\n      第二个非Walker环境验证。cross_env_mechanism_replication=2（Cheetah+Cartpole）满足best档。\n      Cartpole 3/3 exceed 1.5x + borderline peaks证明threshold在simpler environments仍有效。\n\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_052\"\n    description: \"Replicate causal control in Cartpole Swingup\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_105K: 480\n      seed1_nve_peak_35Kplus: 0.98\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.48\n      seed2_eval_105K: 445\n      seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.10\n      seed2_nve_105K: 0.60\n      seed3_eval_105K: 460\n      seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.05\n      seed3_nve_105K: 0.55\n      nve_above_1_5x: \"0/3\"\n      cartpole_classification: \"6/6\"\n      grand_total_classification: \"18/18 = 100%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      去掉dt_embedding → 0/3 exceed nve>1.5x，与Walker/Cheetah完全一致。\n      Cartpole simpler dynamics使no dt_emb configs表现相对更好（eval 445-480，占baseline\n      62-67%），因为lower-dimensional state从noisy reward signal中学习更高效。\n      nve peaks（0.98-1.10x）远低于1.5x。Grand total classification = 18/18 = 100%。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cartpole no dt_emb 3-seed\"\n        data:\n          - {seed: 1, eval_105K: 480, nve_peak: \"0.98x\"}\n          - {seed: 2, eval_105K: 445, nve_peak: \"1.10x\"}\n          - {seed: 3, eval_105K: 460, nve_peak: \"1.05x\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grand classification scatter: 三环境×2组(trained/untrained)所有18个数据点，1.5x line，zero overlap\"\n    analysis: >\n      三环境因果控制完成。18/18 classification = 100%。nve>1.5x作为诊断标记的\n      cross-environment robustness fully established。论文可自信声称\"architecture-level diagnostic\"。\n\n  # ====== Pilot ======\n\n  - name: \"Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot (Walker Walk, 1 seed)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_060\"\n    description: \"RSSM uncertainty-based truncation feasibility test\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_105K: 815\n      vs_baseline_pct: \"89%\"\n      vs_008e_v3_pct: \"93.7%\"\n      nve_105K: 0.75\n      truncation_rate_45K: \"65% of dt>1 steps truncated\"\n      truncation_rate_105K: \"40% (RSSM quality improves)\"\n      mean_effective_dt: 1.35\n      collapse: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      uncertainty-gated truncation在imagination中监控RSSM prediction uncertainty\n      （posterior/prior KL或obs reconstruction error），超threshold时truncate dt>1 steps。\n      early training时RSSM质量差→aggressive truncation（65%），随质量提升truncation率降至40%。\n      eval=815（89% baseline, 94% of 008e_v3）展示feasibility——性能略低于008e_v3因为\n      uncertainty estimation noise导致部分有益dt>1 steps也被truncated。\n      nve=0.75x确认delusional critic被控制。关键价值：证明beyond \"always dt=1\"的方向可行。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Mitigation method comparison\"\n        data:\n          - {method: \"baseline (dt=1)\", eval: 916, nve: 0.66}\n          - {method: \"008e_v3 (always dt=1 imag)\", eval: 870, nve: 0.80}\n          - {method: \"uncertainty-gated\", eval: 815, nve: 0.75}\n          - {method: \"008d (no gate, collapse)\", eval: 83, nve: \"4.12x\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Pilot learning curve vs 008e_v3 vs baseline\"\n      - \"Truncation rate over training: adaptive behavior curve\"\n    analysis: >\n      达到008e_v3的94%（>90% threshold），证明uncertainty-gated approach可行。\n      Discussion中作为concrete future direction：selective dt>1 imagination as RSSM improves。\n\n  # ====== Stretch ======\n\n  - name: \"Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_040\"\n    description: \"Third DMC environment (harder task) for generalization\"\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_IQM_500K: 305\n      baseline_CI: [280, 330]\n      baseline_ve_stable: \"0.55-0.62\"\n      trained_dtEmb_nve_above_1_5x: \"2/3\"\n      trained_dtEmb_collapse: \"1/3\"\n      trained_dtEmb_eval_IQM_105K: 85\n      no_dtEmb_nve_above_1_5x: \"0/3\"\n      no_dtEmb_eval_IQM_105K: 155\n      hopper_classification: \"5/6 (83%)\"\n      grand_total_with_hopper: \"23/24 (96%)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Hopper Hop是较难环境（不稳定dynamics, 低baseline ~300），RSSM prediction质量本身更差。\n      trained dt_emb仍trigger nve>1.5x但2/3（非3/3），因为one seed在极低baseline下\n      v/e ratio denominator波动大（eval ~50-80），诊断标记noise增加使one seed的nve peak\n      停在1.42x（刚below 1.5x）。classification 5/6=83%略低于其他环境100%但仍robust。\n      跨四环境grand total = 23/24 = 96%进一步增强generalization。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Hopper 3-config summary\"\n        data:\n          - {config: \"baseline\", IQM: 305}\n          - {config: \"trained dt_emb\", IQM: 85, nve_exceed: \"2/3\", collapse: \"1/3\"}\n          - {config: \"no dt_emb\", IQM: 155, nve_exceed: \"0/3\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"四环境mechanism replication grid: 2×4 (trained/untrained × 4 envs), nve peaks annotated\"\n    analysis: >\n      P2 stretch goal。Hopper inclusion使scope从3到4环境。5/6 classification + mechanism\n      replication增强generalization。即使不含Hopper，Walker+Cheetah+Cartpole已足够（18/18）。\n\n  # ====== Aggregate ======\n\n  - name: \"Best-tier aggregate metrics\"\n    plan_id: \"aggregate\"\n    description: \"Cross-experiment key metrics summary\"\n    expected_results:\n      C6_recovery_pct_of_baseline: 94.8\n      nve_threshold_classification_accuracy: 1.0\n      cross_env_mechanism_replication: 2\n      collapse_prob_trained_dt_emb: 0.44\n      walker_008e_v3_IQM_pct_baseline: 94.8\n      walker_nve_separating_power: 1.0\n      total_remaining_GPU_hours: ~160\n    result_rationale: >\n      六项关键指标均在best档定义范围内：C6_recovery 94.8%∈[90,98]；classification 1.0∈[0.85,1.0]；\n      cross_env 2∈[2,3]；collapse_prob 0.44∈[0.3,0.65]（Walker 2/3 + Cheetah 1/3 + Cartpole 1/3 = 4/9）；\n      IQM 94.8%∈[88,96]；separating_power 1.0∈[0.9,1.0]。narrative完整闭合：\n      mechanism identification → quantitative diagnostic → cross-env validation →\n      zero-cost mitigation → future direction。所有CoRL reviewer concerns（R1-R8）均有充分回应。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Key metrics vs best-tier targets\"\n        data:\n          - {metric: \"C6 recovery\", value: 94.8, range: \"[90,98]\", status: \"✓\"}\n          - {metric: \"nve classification\", value: 1.0, range: \"[0.85,1.0]\", status: \"✓\"}\n          - {metric: \"cross-env replication\", value: 2, range: \"[2,3]\", status: \"✓\"}\n          - {metric: \"collapse probability\", value: 0.44, range: \"[0.3,0.65]\", status: \"✓\"}\n          - {metric: \"008e_v3 IQM %baseline\", value: 94.8, range: \"[88,96]\", status: \"✓\"}\n          - {metric: \"nve separating power\", value: 1.0, range: \"[0.9,1.0]\", status: \"✓\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Summary figure: 六指标在target range中的位置\"\n    analysis: >\n      best档全面达成。论文framing从single-env diagnostic升级为cross-environment validated\n      diagnostic framework。CoRL strong accept预期有充分数据支撑。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":30199,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":30199},"output_tokens":21,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"54afd05f-72cc-42b5-866f-20a51f9c391e","uuid":"98d1c595-56b5-4179-a010-870df551bedb"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":1081898,"duration_api_ms":1083217,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始framing完全成立。论文以\"DreamerV3中temporal abstraction失败的完整诊断\"为核心，claims覆盖：\n  (1) 机制识别——trained dt_emb通过RSSM fidelity gap导致系统性value overestimation，因果链闭合；\n  (2) 定量诊断标记——nve>1.5x在Walker/Cheetah/Cartpole三环境×多seed中达到100%分类准确率（18/18）；\n  (3) 跨环境验证——2个非Walker环境独立复现机制，collapse概率稳定在0.30-0.65区间；\n  (4) 零成本缓解方案——C6（dt=1 imagination）在Walker 3-seed IQM=95% baseline，CI远离80%线，\n  从mitigation guideline升级为validated recommendation。\n  Discussion可cautiously扩展至其他latent-dynamics架构。CoRL审稿预期strong accept，R1和R6彻底解决。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  # ====== Walker Multi-seed ======\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk baseline seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: \"2 additional seeds for baseline v/e calibration\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_009d_eval_500K: 948\n      seed1_009d_ve_105K: 0.66\n      seed1_009d_ve_stable: 0.70\n      seed2_009a_eval_500K: 942\n      seed2_009a_ve_105K: 0.64\n      seed2_009a_ve_stable: 0.69\n      three_seed_IQM_500K: 947\n      three_seed_CI_95: [935, 959]\n      three_seed_baseline_105K_IQM: 918\n    result_rationale: >\n      Walker Walk在DreamerV3中收敛快且稳定，seed 0已达950.9。009a@336K=919已确认收敛趋势，\n      500K时将稳定在940-950区间。DreamerV3的dt=1 actor-critic在Walker上高度可重复，\n      seed间方差受限于初始化和replay buffer采样的固有随机性（±1-2%）。v/e在135K+稳定在\n      69-72%是discount factor + bootstrapping的固有性质。三seed一致的CI宽度~24\n      为后续所有normalized v/e计算提供坚实参照基线。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Walker Walk baseline 3-seed summary\"\n        data:\n          - {seed: 0, eval_500K: 950.9, ve_105K: 0.656, ve_stable: \"0.69-0.72\"}\n          - {seed: 1, eval_500K: 948, ve_105K: 0.66, ve_stable: \"~0.70\"}\n          - {seed: 2, eval_500K: 942, ve_105K: 0.64, ve_stable: \"~0.69\"}\n          - {aggregate: \"IQM=947, CI_95=[935,959]\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 1 baseline band: 三seed eval learning curve overlay + IQM shaded CI，展示baseline稳定性\"\n      - \"Figure 2 v/e calibration: 三seed v/e ratio随step演变，标注稳定区间69-72%\"\n    analysis: >\n      三seed baseline一致性（CI宽度~24）为后续所有normalized v/e和vs_baseline%计算提供可靠参照。\n      CI不含900以下，Walker baseline鲁棒性确认。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: \"Replicate delusional critic collapse with 2 more seeds\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_009e_eval_trajectory: [31, 152, 160, 135, 118, 72]\n      seed1_009e_nve_35K: 1.78\n      seed1_009e_nve_45K: 2.25\n      seed1_009e_nve_55K: 3.85\n      seed1_009e_collapse: true\n      seed1_009e_collapse_onset_step: 35K\n      seed2_009b_status: \"DONE\"\n      seed2_009b_eval_105K: 267.93\n      seed2_009b_nve_peak_35Kplus: \"1.62x@45K (transient)\"\n      seed2_009b_collapse: false\n      three_seed_nve_above_1_5x_at_35Kplus: \"3/3\"\n      three_seed_collapse_count: \"2/3\"\n      collapse_probability: 0.67\n    result_rationale: >\n      RSSM reward gap 2.78x确保trained dt_emb在所有seed中产生系统性value overestimation。\n      seed 0 (008d)已验证sustained nve>1.5x across 3连续checkpoints→collapse；seed 2 (009b)\n      已验证transient nve>1.5x→self-correction。best档下seed 1 (009e)复现seed 0的sustained\n      pattern：early training stochasticity使overestimation feedback loop在35K前锁定，\n      nve持续加速（1.78x→2.25x→3.85x），actor被误导的policy gradients不可逆转。\n      collapse概率2/3反映bifurcation的stochastic nature（consistent with Henderson et al. 2018），\n      而3/3 exceed 1.5x证明诊断标记的perfect sensitivity。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Walker trained dt_emb 3-seed comparison\"\n        data:\n          - {seed: 0, exp: \"008d\", nve_peak_35Kplus: \"2.09x@45K sustained\", sustained_above_1_5x: \"3 consecutive\", collapse: \"YES\", eval_final: \"83@55K\"}\n          - {seed: 1, exp: \"009e\", nve_peak_35Kplus: \"2.25x@45K sustained\", sustained_above_1_5x: \"3 consecutive\", collapse: \"YES\", eval_final: \"72@55K\"}\n          - {seed: 2, exp: \"009b\", nve_peak_35Kplus: \"1.62x@45K transient\", sustained_above_1_5x: \"1 only\", collapse: \"NO\", eval_final: \"268@105K\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 6扩展: 三seed nve trajectory overlay + 1.5x threshold line，sustained vs transient区间标注\"\n      - \"Collapse bifurcation diagram: sustained nve>1.5x path vs self-correction path\"\n    analysis: >\n      3/3 exceed nve>1.5x（perfect sensitivity）、2/3 collapse（stochastic consequence）。\n      核心论述成立：trained dt_emb是nve>1.5x的reliable trigger（100%），collapse是stochastic\n      but real risk（67%）。结合untrained seeds 0/3 exceed 1.5x，Walker separating power = 6/6。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: \"Replicate causal control stability with 2 more seeds\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_009f_eval_105K: 430\n      seed1_009f_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.08\n      seed1_009f_nve_105K: 0.45\n      seed1_009f_collapse: false\n      seed1_009f_pattern: \"zigzag recovery\"\n      seed2_009c_status: \"DONE\"\n      seed2_009c_eval_105K: 148\n      seed2_009c_nve_105K: 1.14\n      seed2_009c_200K_extension_nve: 1.28\n      seed2_009c_200K_extension_eval: 195\n      three_seed_nve_above_1_5x: \"0/3\"\n      walker_untrained_classification: \"0/3 exceed 1.5x\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      dt_embed_dim=0移除critic利用dt信息的能力（reward gap仅1.01x），阻断value overestimation\n      反馈回路。009f在best档下复现008f seed 0的zigzag recovery（nve peaks 1.08x then decline），\n      因为没有dt_emb conditioning，value function缺乏系统性高估的机制基础。009c虽eval下降且\n      nve@105K=1.14x（上升趋势），但延伸至200K后nve仅达1.28x——overestimation增长速率比\n      008d慢约7x（008c vs 008d数据），远不足以在合理训练时间内达到1.5x。\n      0/3 seeds exceed 1.5x维持与trained seeds的完美分离。性能方差大（148-503）是预期结果：\n      reward prediction退化75x导致学习信号噪声大，但不影响因果结论。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Walker no dt_emb (008f) 3-seed comparison\"\n        data:\n          - {seed: 0, exp: \"008f\", eval_105K: 503, nve_peak: \"1.02x\", nve_105K: 0.30, pattern: \"zigzag recovery\"}\n          - {seed: 1, exp: \"009f\", eval_105K: 430, nve_peak: \"1.08x\", nve_105K: 0.45, pattern: \"zigzag recovery\"}\n          - {seed: 2, exp: \"009c\", eval_105K: 148, nve_peak: \"1.26x\", nve_105K: 1.14, pattern: \"decline after 75K\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 6对比panel: 008f三seed nve（全<1.5x）vs 008d三seed nve（全>1.5x），视觉化separating power\"\n    analysis: >\n      因果控制方向确认：去掉dt_embedding → 0/3 exceed nve>1.5x。008f是因果控制实验（证明方向），\n      不是推荐方案（性能方差大、reward退化严重）。推荐方案仍是008e_v3（C6）。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 (mitigation) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: \"Multi-seed validation of C6 mitigation\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_eval_105K: 869.9\n      seed0_nve_105K: 0.80\n      seed1_eval_105K: 858\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.78\n      seed1_vs_baseline: \"93.5%\"\n      seed2_eval_105K: 882\n      seed2_nve_105K: 0.83\n      seed2_vs_baseline: \"96.1%\"\n      three_seed_IQM: 870\n      three_seed_CI_95: [852, 888]\n      three_seed_IQM_pct_baseline: 94.8\n      CI_lower_vs_80pct_baseline: \"852 >> 732 (80% of 918)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      008e_v3的dt=1 imagination是deterministic选择（gate_dt_1_frac=1.0），不受training\n      stochasticity影响。无论seed如何变化，imagination rollout始终使用dt=1 transition，\n      RSSM在dt=1的高fidelity（obs_MSE 13.49 vs dt=2的27.50）确保value estimates准确。\n      seed间方差仅来自actor optimization的固有随机性（±2-3%），不涉及delusional critic机制。\n      三seed一致收敛到93-96% baseline，IQM=870的CI=[852,888]远高于80%线（732），\n      彻底消除R6对C6可靠性的质疑。nve稳定在0.72-0.83x（健康范围内），确认value estimation\n      正常，无optimistic drift。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Walker C6 mitigation (008e_v3) 3-seed summary\"\n        data:\n          - {seed: 0, eval_105K: 869.9, nve_105K: 0.80, vs_baseline: \"95.0%\"}\n          - {seed: 1, eval_105K: 858, nve_105K: 0.78, vs_baseline: \"93.5%\"}\n          - {seed: 2, eval_105K: 882, nve_105K: 0.83, vs_baseline: \"96.1%\"}\n          - {aggregate: \"IQM=870, CI_95=[852,888], pct_baseline=94.8%\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 1 hero: 008e_v3三seed learning curves叠加baseline CI band，展示一致recovery\"\n      - \"Bar chart: baseline IQM vs 008e_v3 IQM + CI bars，80% threshold line标注\"\n    analysis: >\n      C6从single-seed observation升级为multi-seed validated recommendation。94.8% baseline\n      + tight CI使论文自信声称dt=1 imagination是practical zero-cost mitigation。\n      与008d（collapse）和008f（因果控制但不推荐）的三方对比完成diagnosis-to-mitigation narrative。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: \"Replicate value growth suppression with 2 more seeds\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_105K: 725\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.62\n      seed1_pattern: \"V-recovery with zigzag\"\n      seed2_eval_105K: 695\n      seed2_nve_105K: 0.67\n      seed2_pattern: \"V-recovery\"\n      three_seed_IQM_105K: 733\n      three_seed_vs_baseline: \"80%\"\n      nve_range_105K: [0.59, 0.67]\n    result_rationale: >\n      untrained dt_emb的value growth suppression是structural的（seed 0在55K-105K持续nve<1.0x且\n      趋势进一步diverge from baseline）。新seeds复现同样pattern：untrained embedding阻断critic\n      对dt信息的exploitation，value被结构性压低。V-recovery的zigzag反映actor在被压低的value\n      landscape中exploration效率受限，但最终趋势向上。seed间方差（695-778）来自V-recovery\n      timing的stochastic差异。IQM=733（80% baseline）优于008f但低于008e_v3，论文中定位为\n      \"C3 mechanism understanding\"而非推荐方案。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Walker untrained dt_emb (008a) 3-seed summary\"\n        data:\n          - {seed: 0, eval_105K: 778, nve_105K: 0.59, pattern: \"two V-recoveries\", vs_baseline: \"85%\"}\n          - {seed: 1, eval_105K: 725, nve_105K: 0.62, pattern: \"V-recovery zigzag\", vs_baseline: \"79%\"}\n          - {seed: 2, eval_105K: 695, nve_105K: 0.67, pattern: \"V-recovery\", vs_baseline: \"76%\"}\n          - {aggregate: \"IQM=733, vs_baseline=80%\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"C3 figure: 008a三seed nve vs baseline band，展示structural suppression持续<1.0x\"\n    analysis: >\n      C3多seed验证。value growth suppression confirmed as structural property of untrained dt_emb。\n      与008e_v3对比（80% vs 95%）证明dt=1 imagination is superior to untrained dt_emb as mitigation。\n\n  # ====== Cheetah Run Cross-Environment ======\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_020\"\n    description: \"dt=1 baseline in second DMC environment\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_500K: 775\n      seed2_eval_500K: 790\n      seed3_eval_500K: 785\n      three_seed_IQM_500K: 783\n      three_seed_CI_95: [770, 796]\n      ve_25K: 0.10\n      ve_35K: 0.23\n      ve_45K: 0.31\n      ve_105K: 0.58\n      ve_stable: \"0.62-0.67 from 200K+\"\n      baseline_105K_IQM: 590\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cheetah Run是DMC中与Walker难度相当的连续控制任务。DreamerV3原论文报告~800 at 1M steps，\n      500K下达783符合sample efficiency预期。v/e calibration与Walker类似但收敛稍慢\n      （Cheetah velocity-based reward结构使value estimation需要更多training data），\n      asymptotic v/e略低（0.62-0.67 vs Walker 0.69-0.72）反映reward scale和episode horizon差异。\n      三seed一致性高因为Cheetah dynamics相对光滑。baseline_105K_IQM=590为Cheetah ablation提供参照。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cheetah Run baseline 3-seed v/e calibration\"\n        data:\n          - {step: 25K, ve_mean: 0.10, ve_std: 0.02}\n          - {step: 35K, ve_mean: 0.23, ve_std: 0.03}\n          - {step: 45K, ve_mean: 0.31, ve_std: 0.03}\n          - {step: 105K, ve_mean: 0.58, ve_std: 0.03}\n          - {converged: \"IQM=783, CI=[770,796]\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cross-env baseline panel: Walker vs Cheetah eval + v/e parallel comparison\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cheetah baseline确立。IQM=783和v/e calibration为该环境所有ablation提供normalized v/e\n      计算的reference。\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_021\"\n    description: \"Replicate delusional critic mechanism in Cheetah Run\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_peak: 310\n      seed1_eval_65K: 95\n      seed1_nve_35K: 1.72\n      seed1_nve_45K: 2.35\n      seed1_collapse: true\n      seed2_eval_105K: 245\n      seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus: \"1.65x@45K\"\n      seed2_nve_105K: 0.75\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      seed3_eval_105K: 210\n      seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus: \"1.58x@35K\"\n      seed3_nve_105K: 0.88\n      seed3_collapse: false\n      nve_above_1_5x_count: \"3/3\"\n      collapse_count: \"1/3\"\n      cheetah_trained_classification: \"3/3 exceed 1.5x\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      RSSM fidelity gap是architecture-level property（autoregressive prediction error compounding），\n      不因环境改变。Cheetah的RSSM在dt=2上同样有显著obs/reward prediction退化，trained dt_emb\n      同样使critic exploit imprecise dt>1 predictions。3/3 seeds exceed nve>1.5x与Walker一致\n      （mechanism is environment-independent）。collapse概率1/3略低于Walker的2/3，因为Cheetah\n      velocity-based reward更平滑，self-correction force略强——early overestimation更容易被\n      environment returns纠正。但1/3 collapse仍足以证明real risk（>30% threshold）。\n      seed 1的early stochasticity锁定sustained overestimation pattern，另两seed transient\n      exceed后self-correct。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cheetah Run trained dt_emb 3-seed comparison\"\n        data:\n          - {seed: 1, eval_peak: 310, eval_final: \"95@65K\", nve_peak: \"2.35x@45K\", collapse: \"YES\"}\n          - {seed: 2, eval_peak: 280, eval_final: \"245@105K\", nve_peak: \"1.65x@45K\", collapse: \"NO\"}\n          - {seed: 3, eval_peak: 265, eval_final: \"210@105K\", nve_peak: \"1.58x@35K\", collapse: \"NO\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cross-env nve comparison: Walker vs Cheetah trained dt_emb nve trajectories并排 + 1.5x line\"\n      - \"Cheetah three-seed eval + nve dual-axis plot\"\n    analysis: >\n      第一个非Walker环境验证C2。3/3 exceed nve>1.5x直接回应R1（单环境concern）。\n      collapse概率1/3使跨环境合并概率=(2+1)/(3+3)=50%，在[0.3,0.65]内。\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_022\"\n    description: \"Replicate causal control in Cheetah Run\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_105K: 385\n      seed1_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.05\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.50\n      seed2_eval_105K: 340\n      seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.18\n      seed2_nve_105K: 0.72\n      seed3_eval_105K: 360\n      seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.12\n      seed3_nve_105K: 0.62\n      nve_above_1_5x_count: \"0/3\"\n      cheetah_classification_accuracy: \"6/6 (trained 3/3 exceed + untrained 0/3 exceed)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      与Walker 008f一致：去掉dt_embedding后reward head无法区分dt=1/dt=2（reward gap ~1.0x），\n      value overestimation反馈回路被阻断。Cheetah环境不改变这一机制——RSSM prediction error\n      仍存在但critic无法exploit dt信息。三seed nve peaks（1.05-1.18x）远低于1.5x threshold，\n      与同环境trained dt_emb seeds的1.58-2.35x形成clean separation。eval方差（340-385）\n      反映缺失dt_embedding后reward prediction退化的随机影响，但不影响分类结论。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cheetah Run no dt_emb 3-seed comparison\"\n        data:\n          - {seed: 1, eval_105K: 385, nve_peak: \"1.05x\", nve_105K: 0.50}\n          - {seed: 2, eval_105K: 340, nve_peak: \"1.18x\", nve_105K: 0.72}\n          - {seed: 3, eval_105K: 360, nve_peak: \"1.12x\", nve_105K: 0.62}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cheetah nve threshold scatter: trained seeds (>1.5x) vs untrained seeds (<1.5x)，zero overlap\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cheetah 6/6分类准确率。Combined Walker+Cheetah = 12/12 = 100%。\n      因果控制方向在第二环境独立确认。\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_023\"\n    description: \"Replicate value growth suppression (C3) in Cheetah Run\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_105K: 460\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.58\n      seed1_pattern: \"V-recovery\"\n      seed2_eval_105K: 425\n      seed2_nve_105K: 0.65\n      seed2_pattern: \"V-recovery\"\n      seed3_eval_105K: 440\n      seed3_nve_105K: 0.60\n      seed3_pattern: \"slow climb\"\n      three_seed_IQM: 442\n      vs_baseline_pct: \"75%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      untrained dt_emb的value suppression机制是architecture-level的，Cheetah中同样表现为\n      nve<1.0x structural suppression。Cheetah smoother reward landscape使V-recovery更稳定\n      （较少zigzag），IQM=75% baseline与Walker 80%可比。no subsample保留全部training transitions，\n      与plan_022（subsample ON）的对比可进一步分离subsample vs dt_emb效应（C5 support）。\n      三seed一致在60-75% baseline区间，确认value suppression的cross-env robustness。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cheetah untrained dt_emb 3-seed summary\"\n        data:\n          - {seed: 1, eval_105K: 460, nve_105K: 0.58}\n          - {seed: 2, eval_105K: 425, nve_105K: 0.65}\n          - {seed: 3, eval_105K: 440, nve_105K: 0.60}\n          - {aggregate: \"IQM=442, 75% baseline\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cross-env C3: Walker 008a vs Cheetah untrained dt_emb nve suppression parallel panels\"\n    analysis: >\n      C3跨环境验证。value growth suppression confirmed as architecture-level property。\n      论文C3 evidence表增加Cheetah行。\n\n  # ====== Analysis Experiments ======\n\n  - name: \"RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_030\"\n    description: \"Systematic RSSM fidelity gap measurement across checkpoints and environments\"\n    expected_results:\n      walker_obs_gap_25K: 1.85\n      walker_obs_gap_45K: 2.04\n      walker_obs_gap_105K: 2.20\n      walker_reward_gap_trained: 2.78\n      walker_reward_gap_no_dtEmb: 1.01\n      cheetah_obs_gap_baseline: 2.10\n      cheetah_reward_gap_trained: 2.55\n      cheetah_reward_gap_no_dtEmb: 1.03\n      cartpole_obs_gap_baseline: 1.95\n      cartpole_reward_gap_trained: 2.40\n      gap_nve_pearson_r: 0.87\n    result_rationale: >\n      RSSM autoregressive prediction的compounding error在dt>1时是数学必然——obs gap ~2.0x\n      是两步预测误差近似翻倍的直接反映。trained dt_emb使reward head学到\"dt=2应产生不同reward\"\n      的pattern，但RSSM state质量不支持这个精度，导致reward gap amplification（2.4-2.8x）。\n      no dt_emb时reward gap ~1.0x因为reward head无法区分dt。gap与nve的高相关性（r=0.87）\n      为因果叙事提供定量支撑：fidelity gap越大→overestimation越严重。\n      跨环境obs gap一致（1.95-2.20x）证明这是architecture property。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cross-environment RSSM fidelity table\"\n        data:\n          - {env: \"Walker\", config: \"baseline\", obs_gap: 2.04, reward_gap: 1.56}\n          - {env: \"Walker\", config: \"trained dt_emb\", obs_gap: 1.30, reward_gap: 2.78}\n          - {env: \"Walker\", config: \"no dt_emb\", obs_gap: 2.75, reward_gap: 1.01}\n          - {env: \"Cheetah\", config: \"baseline\", obs_gap: 2.10, reward_gap: 1.50}\n          - {env: \"Cheetah\", config: \"trained dt_emb\", obs_gap: 1.35, reward_gap: 2.55}\n          - {env: \"Cheetah\", config: \"no dt_emb\", obs_gap: 2.80, reward_gap: 1.03}\n          - {env: \"Cartpole\", config: \"baseline\", obs_gap: 1.95, reward_gap: 1.45}\n          - {env: \"Cartpole\", config: \"trained dt_emb\", obs_gap: 1.28, reward_gap: 2.40}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Table 1扩展: 跨环境RSSM fidelity，绝对误差+比率并排，highlight reward gap异常\"\n      - \"Scatter: reward gap vs nve peak across all experiments\"\n    analysis: >\n      跨环境一致的RSSM fidelity gap pattern为C2因果链提供mechanistic foundation。\n      论文可在Discussion中argument：任何latent-dynamics model若有类似fidelity gap，\n      都可能面临同样问题。\n\n  - name: \"Actor entropy analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_031\"\n    description: \"Actor entropy trajectories for healthy vs collapsed configs\"\n    expected_results:\n      healthy_entropy_pattern: \"monotonic decrease 1.4→0.6 over 105K\"\n      collapsed_entropy_pattern: \"decrease to ~0.5@35K then INCREASE to ~0.9@55K\"\n      entropy_increase_magnitude: \"2-3x above healthy at same step\"\n      divergence_onset: \"coincides with nve crossing 1.5x (±5K steps)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      健康训练中actor entropy单调下降反映policy refinement。delusional critic错误gradients\n      使actor丧失learned structure，entropy回升=policy confusion。divergence onset与nve\n      crossing 1.5x同步因为一旦value overestimation足够严重，actor gradient被错误的value\n      landscape主导。这提供C2的independent observable（除nve外的第二个collapse早期信号）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Entropy divergence: healthy (008a/008c/008e_v3) vs collapsed (006/008d) entropy curves\"\n    analysis: >\n      Actor entropy increase与nve>1.5x的temporal coincidence提供因果链的独立证据维度。\n      可作为Discussion中的secondary diagnostic signal。\n\n  - name: \"Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_032\"\n    description: \"Distributional analysis of V(s) vs MC return\"\n    expected_results:\n      trained_dtEmb_distribution: \"heavy right tail, V(s) 1.5-3x above MC return\"\n      untrained_dtEmb_distribution: \"slight left skew, V(s) ~0.8x MC return\"\n      baseline_distribution: \"well-calibrated, ~10-20% overestimation\"\n      kl_trained_vs_true: 0.45\n      kl_untrained_vs_true: 0.12\n      kl_baseline_vs_true: 0.08\n    result_rationale: >\n      trained dt_emb使critic系统性高估dt>1 transitions的value，体现为V(s)分布的heavy right tail。\n      untrained dt_emb抑制这个机制，分布略左偏（value被压低）。KL divergence定量化overestimation\n      程度（0.45 vs 0.08），比单一v/e ratio更informative——展示overestimation的distributional\n      structure而非point estimate。直接回应R3。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"V(s) vs MC return scatter+histogram: 三配置对比，KL标注\"\n    analysis: >\n      回应R3（v/e ratio粗糙proxy）。distributional evidence更rigorous。0 GPU成本，应包含在论文中。\n\n  - name: \"dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_033\"\n    description: \"Learned dt embedding divergence over training\"\n    expected_results:\n      cosine_sim_5K: 0.85\n      cosine_sim_25K: 0.45\n      cosine_sim_45K: 0.25\n      cosine_sim_105K: 0.20\n      divergence_onset: \"15K-25K\"\n      norm_ratio_dt2_over_dt1_105K: 1.35\n    result_rationale: >\n      dt_embedding初始化为random（cosine ~0.85 at 5K），world model训练中学习区分dt=1/dt=2\n      dynamics差异，embedding vectors diverge。divergence onset（15K-25K）与reward gap开始\n      amplify的时间一致：embedding divergence赋予reward head区分dt的能力，进而创造系统性bias。\n      dt=2 norm比dt=1高1.35x反映model对dt>1的重视，但RSSM state质量不支持这个精度。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"dt_embedding evolution\"\n        data:\n          - {step: 5K, cosine_sim: 0.85, norm_ratio: 1.02}\n          - {step: 25K, cosine_sim: 0.45, norm_ratio: 1.20}\n          - {step: 45K, cosine_sim: 0.25, norm_ratio: 1.30}\n          - {step: 105K, cosine_sim: 0.20, norm_ratio: 1.35}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Embedding divergence timeline + nve onset annotation\"\n    analysis: >\n      embedding-level evidence: trained dt_emb确实学到区分dt的representation，\n      这正是trigger overestimation的前提。与untrained dt_emb（cosine ~0.85 throughout）对比。\n\n  # ====== Cartpole Swingup Cross-Environment ======\n\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_050\"\n    description: \"dt=1 baseline in non-locomotion DMC environment\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_500K: 842\n      seed2_eval_500K: 850\n      seed3_eval_500K: 838\n      three_seed_IQM: 843\n      three_seed_CI_95: [835, 851]\n      ve_35K: 0.25\n      ve_105K: 0.56\n      ve_stable: \"0.60-0.65\"\n      baseline_105K_IQM: 720\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cartpole Swingup作为非locomotion环境拓宽scope。DreamerV3在Cartpole上表现优异\n      （原论文~860 at 1M），500K下达843合理。Cartpole dynamics相对简单（4D state），\n      训练方差小（CI宽度~16）。v/e收敛略低（0.60-0.65）反映shorter effective episode horizon。\n      作为非locomotion task，其inclusion直接回应\"are results specific to walking tasks\"的concern。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cartpole baseline 3-seed\"\n        data:\n          - {seed: 1, eval_500K: 842, ve_105K: 0.55}\n          - {seed: 2, eval_500K: 850, ve_105K: 0.57}\n          - {seed: 3, eval_500K: 838, ve_105K: 0.56}\n          - {aggregate: \"IQM=843, CI=[835,851]\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"三环境baseline panel: Walker/Cheetah/Cartpole parallel eval curves\"\n    analysis: >\n      非locomotion baseline建立。三环境scope增强论文generalization claim。\n\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_051\"\n    description: \"Replicate delusional critic in Cartpole Swingup\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_65K: 125\n      seed1_nve_45K: 2.10\n      seed1_collapse: true\n      seed2_eval_105K: 305\n      seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus: \"1.55x@45K\"\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      seed3_eval_105K: 285\n      seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus: \"1.52x@35K\"\n      seed3_collapse: false\n      nve_above_1_5x: \"3/3\"\n      collapse_count: \"1/3\"\n      cartpole_trained_classification: \"3/3 exceed 1.5x\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      RSSM fidelity gap是architecture property，不依赖环境复杂度。即使Cartpole dynamics更简单\n      （4D vs Walker 24D），autoregressive dt>1 prediction error compounding仍存在。\n      trained dt_emb在Cartpole中同样trigger nve>1.5x：3/3 seeds exceed threshold。\n      collapse概率1/3与Cheetah一致——simpler dynamics使self-correction更有效，但overestimation\n      本身仍可靠出现。seed 2/3的borderline peaks（1.52-1.55x）加强1.5x threshold的\n      discriminative precision——even in easiest test environment，trained dt_emb reliably crosses。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cartpole trained dt_emb 3-seed\"\n        data:\n          - {seed: 1, nve_peak: \"2.10x@45K\", collapse: \"YES\"}\n          - {seed: 2, nve_peak: \"1.55x@45K\", collapse: \"NO\"}\n          - {seed: 3, nve_peak: \"1.52x@35K\", collapse: \"NO\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"三环境nve threshold figure: Walker/Cheetah/Cartpole trained vs untrained，1.5x line\"\n    analysis: >\n      第二个非Walker环境验证。cross_env_mechanism_replication=2（Cheetah+Cartpole）满足best档。\n      Cartpole 3/3 exceed 1.5x + borderline peaks证明threshold在simpler environments仍有效。\n\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_052\"\n    description: \"Replicate causal control in Cartpole Swingup\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_105K: 480\n      seed1_nve_peak_35Kplus: 0.98\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.48\n      seed2_eval_105K: 445\n      seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.10\n      seed2_nve_105K: 0.60\n      seed3_eval_105K: 460\n      seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.05\n      seed3_nve_105K: 0.55\n      nve_above_1_5x: \"0/3\"\n      cartpole_classification: \"6/6\"\n      grand_total_classification: \"18/18 = 100%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      去掉dt_embedding → 0/3 exceed nve>1.5x，与Walker/Cheetah完全一致。\n      Cartpole simpler dynamics使no dt_emb configs表现相对更好（eval 445-480，占baseline\n      62-67%），因为lower-dimensional state从noisy reward signal中学习更高效。\n      nve peaks（0.98-1.10x）远低于1.5x。Grand total classification = 18/18 = 100%。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cartpole no dt_emb 3-seed\"\n        data:\n          - {seed: 1, eval_105K: 480, nve_peak: \"0.98x\"}\n          - {seed: 2, eval_105K: 445, nve_peak: \"1.10x\"}\n          - {seed: 3, eval_105K: 460, nve_peak: \"1.05x\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grand classification scatter: 三环境×2组(trained/untrained)所有18个数据点，1.5x line，zero overlap\"\n    analysis: >\n      三环境因果控制完成。18/18 classification = 100%。nve>1.5x作为诊断标记的\n      cross-environment robustness fully established。论文可自信声称\"architecture-level diagnostic\"。\n\n  # ====== Pilot ======\n\n  - name: \"Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot (Walker Walk, 1 seed)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_060\"\n    description: \"RSSM uncertainty-based truncation feasibility test\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_105K: 815\n      vs_baseline_pct: \"89%\"\n      vs_008e_v3_pct: \"93.7%\"\n      nve_105K: 0.75\n      truncation_rate_45K: \"65% of dt>1 steps truncated\"\n      truncation_rate_105K: \"40% (RSSM quality improves)\"\n      mean_effective_dt: 1.35\n      collapse: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      uncertainty-gated truncation在imagination中监控RSSM prediction uncertainty\n      （posterior/prior KL或obs reconstruction error），超threshold时truncate dt>1 steps。\n      early training时RSSM质量差→aggressive truncation（65%），随质量提升truncation率降至40%。\n      eval=815（89% baseline, 94% of 008e_v3）展示feasibility——性能略低于008e_v3因为\n      uncertainty estimation noise导致部分有益dt>1 steps也被truncated。\n      nve=0.75x确认delusional critic被控制。关键价值：证明beyond \"always dt=1\"的方向可行。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Mitigation method comparison\"\n        data:\n          - {method: \"baseline (dt=1)\", eval: 916, nve: 0.66}\n          - {method: \"008e_v3 (always dt=1 imag)\", eval: 870, nve: 0.80}\n          - {method: \"uncertainty-gated\", eval: 815, nve: 0.75}\n          - {method: \"008d (no gate, collapse)\", eval: 83, nve: \"4.12x\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Pilot learning curve vs 008e_v3 vs baseline\"\n      - \"Truncation rate over training: adaptive behavior curve\"\n    analysis: >\n      达到008e_v3的94%（>90% threshold），证明uncertainty-gated approach可行。\n      Discussion中作为concrete future direction：selective dt>1 imagination as RSSM improves。\n\n  # ====== Stretch ======\n\n  - name: \"Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_040\"\n    description: \"Third DMC environment (harder task) for generalization\"\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_IQM_500K: 305\n      baseline_CI: [280, 330]\n      baseline_ve_stable: \"0.55-0.62\"\n      trained_dtEmb_nve_above_1_5x: \"2/3\"\n      trained_dtEmb_collapse: \"1/3\"\n      trained_dtEmb_eval_IQM_105K: 85\n      no_dtEmb_nve_above_1_5x: \"0/3\"\n      no_dtEmb_eval_IQM_105K: 155\n      hopper_classification: \"5/6 (83%)\"\n      grand_total_with_hopper: \"23/24 (96%)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Hopper Hop是较难环境（不稳定dynamics, 低baseline ~300），RSSM prediction质量本身更差。\n      trained dt_emb仍trigger nve>1.5x但2/3（非3/3），因为one seed在极低baseline下\n      v/e ratio denominator波动大（eval ~50-80），诊断标记noise增加使one seed的nve peak\n      停在1.42x（刚below 1.5x）。classification 5/6=83%略低于其他环境100%但仍robust。\n      跨四环境grand total = 23/24 = 96%进一步增强generalization。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Hopper 3-config summary\"\n        data:\n          - {config: \"baseline\", IQM: 305}\n          - {config: \"trained dt_emb\", IQM: 85, nve_exceed: \"2/3\", collapse: \"1/3\"}\n          - {config: \"no dt_emb\", IQM: 155, nve_exceed: \"0/3\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"四环境mechanism replication grid: 2×4 (trained/untrained × 4 envs), nve peaks annotated\"\n    analysis: >\n      P2 stretch goal。Hopper inclusion使scope从3到4环境。5/6 classification + mechanism\n      replication增强generalization。即使不含Hopper，Walker+Cheetah+Cartpole已足够（18/18）。\n\n  # ====== Aggregate ======\n\n  - name: \"Best-tier aggregate metrics\"\n    plan_id: \"aggregate\"\n    description: \"Cross-experiment key metrics summary\"\n    expected_results:\n      C6_recovery_pct_of_baseline: 94.8\n      nve_threshold_classification_accuracy: 1.0\n      cross_env_mechanism_replication: 2\n      collapse_prob_trained_dt_emb: 0.44\n      walker_008e_v3_IQM_pct_baseline: 94.8\n      walker_nve_separating_power: 1.0\n      total_remaining_GPU_hours: ~160\n    result_rationale: >\n      六项关键指标均在best档定义范围内：C6_recovery 94.8%∈[90,98]；classification 1.0∈[0.85,1.0]；\n      cross_env 2∈[2,3]；collapse_prob 0.44∈[0.3,0.65]（Walker 2/3 + Cheetah 1/3 + Cartpole 1/3 = 4/9）；\n      IQM 94.8%∈[88,96]；separating_power 1.0∈[0.9,1.0]。narrative完整闭合：\n      mechanism identification → quantitative diagnostic → cross-env validation →\n      zero-cost mitigation → future direction。所有CoRL reviewer concerns（R1-R8）均有充分回应。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Key metrics vs best-tier targets\"\n        data:\n          - {metric: \"C6 recovery\", value: 94.8, range: \"[90,98]\", status: \"✓\"}\n          - {metric: \"nve classification\", value: 1.0, range: \"[0.85,1.0]\", status: \"✓\"}\n          - {metric: \"cross-env replication\", value: 2, range: \"[2,3]\", status: \"✓\"}\n          - {metric: \"collapse probability\", value: 0.44, range: \"[0.3,0.65]\", status: \"✓\"}\n          - {metric: \"008e_v3 IQM %baseline\", value: 94.8, range: \"[88,96]\", status: \"✓\"}\n          - {metric: \"nve separating power\", value: 1.0, range: \"[0.9,1.0]\", status: \"✓\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Summary figure: 六指标在target range中的位置\"\n    analysis: >\n      best档全面达成。论文framing从single-env diagnostic升级为cross-environment validated\n      diagnostic framework。CoRL strong accept预期有充分数据支撑。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"54afd05f-72cc-42b5-866f-20a51f9c391e","total_cost_usd":1.5663182500000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":30199,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":53855,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":30199,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":53855,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":30199,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":30199},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":25159,"outputTokens":22,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.025269,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":53855,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":30199,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.5410492500000001,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"fec28064-ac1f-4f7e-9d85-345e77df11ad"}
